  "bulletin": {
    "id": "1154",
    "issue_date": "2026-06-01T12:15:00.000Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-06-01T11:35:32.546Z",
    "meteorologist": "Hari Dahal",
    "analysis_np": "हाल नेपालमा उपल्लो वायुमण्डलमा रहेको पश्चिमी न्युन चापीय रेखा (trough) तथा स्थानीय वायूको प्रभाव रहेको छ ।",
    "analysis_en": "At present, Nepal is under the influence of a westerly low-pressure trough (trough) in the upper atmosphere, along with the influence of local winds.",
    "today_np": "देशको हिमाली भू-भागमा साधारणतया बादल,  पहाडी भू-भागमा आंशिक बादल लाग्नेछ र तराई भू-भागमा मुख्यतया सफा रहने छ।  देशको हिमाली र पहाडी भूभागका एक-दुई स्थानमा  हल्का वर्षा/हिमपातको सम्भावना रहेको छ ।",
    "today_en": "Generally cloudy conditions are likely over the Himalayan region of the country, while partly cloudy conditions are likely over the Hilly region and mainly fair weather is likely over the Terai region. There is a possibility of light rainfall/snowfall at one or two places in the Hilly and Himalayan regions of the country.",
    "tomorrow_np": "देशको हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागमा साधारणतया बादल लाग्नेछ तथा तराई भू-भागमा आंशिक बादल लाग्नेछ। देशको हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागका थोरै स्थानहरूमा तथा लुम्बिनी र सुदुरपश्चिम प्रदेशका तराई भू-भागका एक-दुई स्थानमा मेघगर्जन/चट्याङ्ग सहित मध्यमसम्मको वर्षा/हिमपातको सम्भावना रहेको छ । मधेश  प्रदेशमा तथा  कोशी प्रदेशको तराईमा तातो दिन  हुने सम्भावना रहेको छ।",
    "tomorrow_en": "Generally cloudy conditions are likely over the Hilly and Himalayan regions of the country, while partly cloudy conditions are likely over the Terai region. There is a possibility of moderate rainfall/snowfall accompanied by thunder and lightning at a few places in the Hilly and Himalayan regions of the country and at one or two places in the Terai regions of Lumbini Province and Sudurpashchim Province. Hot day conditions are also likely in Madhesh Province and the Terai region of Koshi Province.",
    "special": ""
  }
